## Schema

### Required

- `description` (String) Group description.
- `name` (String) Group name. Must be unique across your Orca org.
- `sso_group` (Boolean) SSO permissions group vs Orca-only. Create-time only; changing it replaces the resource.

### Optional

- `users` (Set of String) Member user IDs (/api/users). API does not return membership on read; external removals are not detected.

### Read-Only

- `id` (String) Group ID.
